    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nNo. 85 Danesfort Drive is a modern four bedroom home, located in a private, well established residential development within walking distance of Loughrea town centre and all it's social and recreational amenities. Creche facilities available within development also.\nBoasting bright and spacious accommodation, this residence is presented for sale in excellent condition, affording one the opportunity here to acquire a quality energy efficient home in a most convenient location.Viewing is highly recommended and can be arranged through selling agents."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 2.19m x 4.91m\nFront aspect window and door, wooden flooring\n\nLiving Room - 3.44m x 5.29m\nFront aspect window, solid fuel stove with wooden surround, French doors leading to kitchen, wooden flooring\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.73m x 3.96m\nRear aspect widow and sliding door, wall and base units, tile flooring\n\nUtility Room - 1.58m x 3.47m\nRear aspect door, wall and base units, tile flooring\n\nGroundfloor wc - 1.14m x 2.50m\nwhb/wc, tile flooring\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 0.94m x 3.31m\nHotpress/airing cupboard off, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.29m x 3.97m\nRear aspect window, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.35m x 2.37m\nRear aspect window, fitted wardrobe, wooden flooring\n\nBathroom - 2.17m x 1.78m\nSide aspect window, whb with fitted storage/wc/shower, floor to ceiling tiling\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.00m x 4.06m\nFront aspect window, fitted wardrobe, wooden flooring- Ensuite: 2.96m x 0.90m - Side aspect window, whb/wc/electric shower, panelled walls, tiled flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.67m x 2.60m\nFront aspect window, wooden flooring\n\nGarden - \nLarge garden to rear with side access, patio area, laid to lawn, fence and brick boundary\n\nGarden Room/Office - \nSide aspect window and door, large space for garden room, office or storage\n\n"
      },
